WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:03.436
-Thank you. Thank you so much.

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:05.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was just home,
visiting my parents,

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:06.906
and I did not get that reaction.

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:08.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
So that was great.

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:11.011 size:84% position:42%
They´re just sort of
vaguely confused by me,

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.712 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I try to
remember that, you know,

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:14.047
they grew up in a simpler time.

00:00:14.047 --> 00:00:16.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, my dad´s high-school
girlfriend dumped him

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:20.487 align:start size:94% position:6%
because he didn´t
have enough school spirit.

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:23.390
Which I think is the best reason
ever to dump someone.

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:26.326
That makes me want to go back in
time just so I can be like,

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:31.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I´m sorry, Wally.
You know what´s comin´.

00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:33.133 align:start size:94% position:6%
You don´t have
enough school spirit.

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:35.201 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s over.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:36.369 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, don´t be cross.

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:38.171
I just don´t think I can put out

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:41.307
unless you get more enthusiastic
about the Wildcats."

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:43.309 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:48.148 --> 00:00:50.050 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you.
And my dad is on Facebook.

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:52.419 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don´t know if anybody has
a parent on Facebook,

00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:53.520 size:81% position:41%
but it´s so upsetting.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:56.656 align:start size:94% position:6%
He´s very active.

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:58.958 align:start size:94% position:6%
His profile picture
is so confusing.

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:02.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
He´s just sort of
glaring into the distance.

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:05.065 size:84% position:42%
I´m like, "Why would he
choose that picture?

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:08.201
He looks actively furious."

00:01:08.201 --> 00:01:11.538 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just has this confusing,
haunting expression.

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:12.872 size:88% position:44%
And then he writes these

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:17.544 align:start size:94% position:6%
long, political,
unstable rants on Facebook.

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:19.612
And he doesn´t understand how
to edit what he´s written,

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:22.982
so he edits by putting a comment
beneath what he just wrote,

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:26.786 size:88% position:44%
in the comments section.

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:29.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
He´ll be like,
"I want to apologize,

00:01:29.022 --> 00:01:31.891 align:start size:94% position:6%
but, in the passion of my
earlier statement,

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:41.067 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´ve misspelled
the following words."

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:45.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then he likes
his own comment.

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:49.576
And my mom likes to log in and
use my father´s Facebook page.

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:52.278
She goes, "Me and your father --
we share a Facebook page."

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:53.546
I´m like, "That´s not a thing.

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:55.482
You can´t make that a thing.

00:01:55.482 --> 00:01:59.552 align:start size:94% position:6%
Dad has his own demonic page,
and that´s his."

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:02.388
And she goes, "Well, I like to
log in to your father´s account,

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:04.390 size:81% position:41%
because I like to tell
all your girlfriends

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:07.927 align:start size:94% position:6%
when they look gorgeous
in their photos."

00:02:12.098 --> 00:02:13.600 align:start size:94% position:6%
So it´s a disaster.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:18.204
It just looks like my father is
hitting on all of my friends.

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:21.207
Anytime any of my girlfriends
post a picture of themselves,

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:22.742
my dad will, like, literally --

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:25.145
My mom will leap on to
my father´s Facebook page

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:26.813
and be like, "My goodness.

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:31.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
What a foxy figure
you have, Lisa.

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:34.287
Now, I just refuse to believe

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:39.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
you ever had a baby,
with that smokin´-hot bod.

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:42.328 size:78% position:39%
You are a real dish."

00:02:42.328 --> 00:02:46.499 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then there´s
my dad just glaring.

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:48.368 size:75% position:38%
with this confusing,

00:02:48.368 --> 00:02:50.336 align:start size:94% position:6%
satanic expression.

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:54.641 align:start size:94% position:6%
It just looks like
he´s seducing all my friends.

00:02:54.641 --> 00:02:57.810
I was looking for any reason
to escape my parents´s house,

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.345 size:88% position:44%
and I took a spin class.

00:02:59.345 --> 00:03:00.747
I never do things like that.

00:03:00.747 --> 00:03:02.215 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just wanted to go for
the cycling part,

00:03:02.215 --> 00:03:03.449 align:start size:94% position:6%
but then they
were doing all this

00:03:03.449 --> 00:03:07.153 align:start size:94% position:6%
inspirational yelling
in the class.

00:03:07.153 --> 00:03:08.788 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don´t know why that´s
happening with exercise now.

00:03:08.788 --> 00:03:10.290 size:88% position:44%
Like, I don´t need that.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:13.593
I don´t like that idea of like,
"We´re all in this together!"

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:16.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s like,
"No, we´re not, Kelsey.

00:03:16.396 --> 00:03:18.431
We are not in this together.

00:03:18.431 --> 00:03:20.533 align:start size:94% position:6%
If I showed up at your house,
you´d call the police.

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:23.336
That´s what would happen."

00:03:23.336 --> 00:03:26.005 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then she sensed me
resisting, the instructor.

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:29.008
She just kept trying to pull
me in on the jazz of it all.

00:03:29.008 --> 00:03:32.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
She goes, "Look at
Rachel over there, Bike 36.

00:03:32.378 --> 00:03:36.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
She´s in the corner there
thinking, ´I´m a rock star.´"

00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:40.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´m like, "I have never
had that thought in my life."

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:49.929
I´m like, "How dare you, Kelsey?
Don´t tell me what my mind says.

00:03:49.929 --> 00:03:52.232 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´m quietly dying in
a private corner

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:53.833
that I´ve chosen for myself.

00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:58.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´ve never even thought,
´I´m a rock.´"

00:03:58.071 --> 00:03:59.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then they
make you say things

00:03:59.706 --> 00:04:00.974
to the person next to you.

00:04:00.974 --> 00:04:01.841 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s so awful.

00:04:01.841 --> 00:04:03.109
The instructor just kept going,

00:04:03.109 --> 00:04:04.577 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Look at your neighbor
on your right.

00:04:04.577 --> 00:04:06.579 size:81% position:41%
I want you to give her
a high five and say,

00:04:06.579 --> 00:04:07.680 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Get it, girl!´"

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.949
I´m like,
"That´s one of the worst things

00:04:09.949 --> 00:04:12.518
I´ve ever been asked to do."

00:04:12.518 --> 00:04:13.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was panicking.

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:16.756 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´m like,
"Is there a second option?

00:04:16.756 --> 00:04:19.792 align:start size:94% position:6%
Can I just kill
a bird or something?"

00:04:25.865 --> 00:04:28.534
And then she goes,
"Everyone, this is your moment.

00:04:28.534 --> 00:04:31.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
I want you to take control
of your life right now

00:04:31.337 --> 00:04:33.273
and remove any toxic force

00:04:33.273 --> 00:04:37.443 align:start size:94% position:6%
that no longer serves you
on your journey."

00:04:37.443 --> 00:04:41.247 align:start size:94% position:6%
And this girl just goes,
"I hate you, Scott!"

00:04:45.385 --> 00:04:49.889 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that brought me
so much joy that I realized,

00:04:49.889 --> 00:04:51.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Maybe I´m just
a terrible person.

00:04:51.758 --> 00:04:53.259
Maybe that´s the problem."

00:04:53.259 --> 00:04:55.261
´Cause this poor woman´s pain
is gonna fill me up for months.

00:04:55.261 --> 00:04:56.663 size:84% position:42%
I was laughing so hard,

00:04:56.663 --> 00:05:00.433 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was bent over,
weeping on my bike.

00:05:00.433 --> 00:05:03.436
That happened a long time ago,
and I still walk back and forth

00:05:03.436 --> 00:05:05.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
with my roommate
several times a day --

00:05:05.204 --> 00:05:07.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
Every time I pass her in
my apartment, I´m just like,

00:05:07.473 --> 00:05:10.343 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I hate you, Scott!

00:05:10.343 --> 00:05:14.013 align:start size:94% position:6%
This time, it´s real, Scott.
I have boundaries.

00:05:14.013 --> 00:05:17.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
I deserve better, Scott.
I´m a rock star."

00:05:17.784 --> 00:05:19.118
And she´s like, "Whatever.

00:05:19.118 --> 00:05:21.521 align:start size:94% position:6%
Your dad just called me
a smoke show on Facebook."

00:05:21.521 --> 00:05:23.523 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

